sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin User
    participant Page as AdminTenantDetail
    participant API_Billing as GET /internal/tenants/:id/billing
    participant API_Events as GET /internal/tenants/:id/events
    participant State as Component State

    Note over Admin,State: === Initial page load ===

    Admin->>Page: Navigate to /admin/tenants/:id
    Page->>Page: Set loading = true
    Page->>API_Billing: GET /api/v1/internal/tenants/:id/billing

    API_Billing-->>Page: Response with billing summary
    Note over API_Billing,Page: { tenantId, balance, isActive, ...<br/>recentEvents: [...],<br/>eventsHasMore: true/false,<br/>eventsNextCursor: 42 | null }

    Page->>State: setAllEvents(recentEvents)
    Page->>State: setEventsHasMore(eventsHasMore)
    Page->>State: setEventsNextCursor(eventsNextCursor)
    Page-->>Admin: Render billing summary + event list

    Note over Admin,State: === Load older events (cursor pagination) ===

    alt eventsHasMore is true
        Admin->>Page: Click "Load older" button

        Page->>Page: Set loadingOlder = true
        Page->>API_Events: GET /api/v1/internal/tenants/:id/events?beforeId=42

        alt 401 Unauthorized
            API_Events-->>Page: 401
            Page->>State: logout() - clear session, redirect
        else Error response
            API_Events-->>Page: { error: "..." }
            Page-->>Admin: Show older-events error message
        else Success
            API_Events-->>Page: { events: [...], hasMore: true/false, nextCursor: 17 | null }

            Page->>State: Append events to allEvents
            Page->>State: setEventsHasMore(hasMore)
            Page->>State: setEventsNextCursor(nextCursor)
            Page-->>Admin: Render appended events in list
        end

        Note over Admin,Page: Admin can repeat "Load older"<br/>until eventsHasMore = false,<br/>each time passing the latest cursor.
    else eventsHasMore is false
        Note over Page: "Load older" button hidden.<br/>All events are loaded.
    end

    Note over Admin,State: === Full refresh resets pagination ===

    Admin->>Page: Click "Refresh" button
    Page->>API_Billing: GET /api/v1/internal/tenants/:id/billing
    API_Billing-->>Page: Fresh billing data
    Page->>State: Reset allEvents, eventsHasMore,<br/>eventsNextCursor from response
    Page-->>Admin: Render fresh event list from beginning
